# Layer A density v4 fixture: 21-fixpoint-factorial combining BOTH
# nested expressions AND deeper Elaborator type inference.
#
# Single-statement factorial body via nested IF branches (Agent A's
# Slice 10 nested expressions). The `factT FNT [intT] intT` declaration
# and BOTH LAM param annotations (`recurse:factT n:intT`) elided —
# inferred by the Elaborator's compact-LAM-param walk after the v4
# follow-up extended it to descend into Arg.Nested.
#
# Five lines for what canonical JSON writes in ~30. Round-trip hash
# equals 21-fixpoint-factorial.json's.
@v=1 root=app
matchBody IF (APP eqInt [n 0]) 1 (APP mul [n (APP recurse [(APP sub [n 1])])])
bodyLam LAM [recurse n] matchBody
fact FIX factT bodyLam
app APP fact [5]
